 about 100 m; eastern cores and isopycnal layers differ. No single depth is imposed on the route; surface SEC/NECC and deeper equatorial currents remain separate.","excluded_inferences":["Do not treat source transport changes or vertical thickness as horizontal width.","Do not transfer surface NASA swirls to thermocline current identification.","Do not identify modeled island-generated anticyclones as named registry eddies.","Do not compare this truncated reach directly with whole Pacific EUC length."],"remaining_gates":["Review 35 W and pre-island truncation; source retroflections and eastern branches are not represented.","Obtain compatible depth/time-resolved velocity axis before physical length or seasonal dimensions.","Resolve island interaction and return-flow topology without treating generated eddies as named identities.","No occupied footprint, route-buffer width or whole-basin system length inferred.","Resolve campaign 7910/7912 Table I/II date conflicts before dated frames.","Extract reproducible paired velocity edges from original sections before assigning local horizontal width."],"section_properties":{"schema":"osw.atlantic-euc-section-properties.v1","current_id":"atlantic-equatorial-undercurrent","status":"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical","source_url":"https://horizon.documentation.ird.fr/exl-doc/pleins_textes/cahiers/ocea_tro/15471.pdf","source_document_file":"research/source-data/voituriez-atlantic-euc-1983/journal-article.pdf","source_document_sha256":"a1c4b1dfc46247cb9c7da90ea03aa1a240bc987bd26b21c9cdf49f027d457e0b","source_document_bytes":1887693,"acquisition_file":"research/source-data/voituriez-atlantic-euc-1983/acquisition.json","acquisition_sha256":"1734746902c37f4fe31bc0dbf2a39b6f173a96e0759aa7604257683cca32736b","protocol_file":"plans/atlantic-euc-section-properties-protocol-v1.md","protocol_sha256":"4d8ff5480aba2d14be3d3a082e805f9b90843c2db5fb6ef52bc46f1d596a068e","source_locator":"Printed pp165,167–168: Table I, Figure 2, Table 